<title>USA: Compaq buy rating repeated by Bear Stearns.</title>
<headline>Compaq buy rating repeated by Bear Stearns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns analyst Andrew Neff reiterated a buy rating on Compaq Computer Corp and maintained his 1996 and 1997 earnings estimates on the computer maker, a contact at Bear Stearns said.</p>
<p>Neff maintained his 1996 estimates of $4.60 a share for 1996 and 1997 estimates of $5.60 a share, saying that orders are strong, after a recent visit with company officials.</p>
<p>Neff was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>Shares of Compaq jumped 2-1/8 to 68-1/2 in heavy trading.</p>
</text>
